# Global conduct

## Communication
- Extremely concise; sacrifice grammar for concision
- Docs: active voice, no cognitive overload

## Collaboration
- Be critical of ideas to think through issues rigorously
- Keep humans in control: present options/tradeoffs, confirm risky ops
- Open questions → answer and review, do not make changes

## Code
- No narrating comments; comment non-obvious intent/constraints only
- Never push commits — user always pushes
